    <string name="privacy_policy_body">Nuvexa runs entirely on your device. It does not create a user account, does not upload your photos, documents, text, or clipboard content, and does not use any cloud service for its tools. Data such as favorites, history entries, and settings are stored locally in this app\'s private storage and are never transmitted anywhere. The only network activity in Nuvexa is optional ad serving through Google AdMob; every tool works fully offline.</string>
    <string name="terms_body">Nuvexa is provided free of charge, as-is, for personal use. You are responsible for the content you process with its tools. Nuvexa\'s calculators, converters, and generators are provided for convenience and general use; verify results independently for critical financial, legal, or medical decisions.</string>

